# Get your free token at https://account.mapbox.com/
# 1. Sign up / log in at mapbox.com
# 2. Go to https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# 3. Copy your "Default public token" (starts with pk.)
# 4. Rename this file from .env.example to .env
# 5. Paste your token below after the = sign (no quotes needed)

VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=your_token_here
